on-sectarian or illegal disciple traditions,\nthe people associated with them, and many other non-sectarian traditions that may arise in the future, may be destroyed, and they may not be called devotees of Shri Chaitanya\nMahaprabhu. Along with that, the Mahaprabhu (great lord) told his followers about these deceivers"
